"entity": {
"name": "Dometic Group AB",
"description": "Dometic Group AB engages in the provision of branded solutions for mobile living in the areas of climate; power and control; hygiene and sanitation; and food and beverage. It operates through the following geographical segments: Americas; Europe, Middle East, and Africa (EMEA); Asia Pacific (APAC); Marine; and Global. The Marine segment includes the entire Dometic marine operation. The Global segment focuses on the other global verticals such as residential, hospitality, and mobile deliveries; and Igloo business, a supplier of passive cooling boxes and drinkware products. The company was founded in 1968 and is headquartered in Solna, Sweden.",
